{"unit_id":"liangdabiao__dsh-weather-plugin#card-zh","repo":"liangdabiao/dsh-weather-plugin","commit":"a0326c0073b7c057703104d97b58458528d80c97","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Weather Plugin 是面向 DSH 网页端和命令行的天气插件：用户询问城市天气时，它通过 weather 工具查询 Open-Meteo，并把结果交给 weather-briefing 技能和系统提示组织播报。网页端会把结构化结果显示为动态天气卡片，涵盖晴、多云、阴、雾、雨、雪和雷暴场景，并展示温度、风向风速及可用的日温范围。适合需要在 DSH 中查询城市当前天气并直观看到天气状况的用户。默认使用 Open-Meteo 地理编码和天气 API，不需要 API Key；可配置 API 地址和请求超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:31-59","src/tool.ts:58-80","src/client/index.tsx:141-164"]}
{"unit_id":"liangdabiao__dsh-weather-plugin#card-en","repo":"liangdabiao/dsh-weather-plugin","commit":"a0326c0073b7c057703104d97b58458528d80c97","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Weather Plugin looks up a city’s current weather through Open-Meteo. Its bundled skill guides the briefing, and the web client renders an animated card with weather, temperature, and wind details. No API key is needed by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:31-59","src/tool.ts:58-80","src/client/index.tsx:141-164"]}
